  "description": "Staying alive is a new form of entertainment.\n\nWhen Do-Kyung, disillusioned by the harshness of life, finally resolves to call it quits, a bored demon, Hwamyung, appears before her with a particular offer. Will Do-Kyung, having entered into a contract with the Demon of Disillusionment, be able to flip her disastrous life upside down?\n\n(Source: Manta)",
